+# meta/sessions/
+
+Session records, per `CG-rule-06`: one directory per session, named by date and slug. A session
+record says what the session was given, read, proposed, ruled and did. It is not edited after the
+session closes. Corrections are appended notes, never edits.
+
+## Repository locations in records before 2026-10-06
+
+Session records dated before `2026-10-06-post-move-repair` name repositories as
+`Hafeok/…`. That is where they were read, and the records are left as read.
+
+On 2026-10-06, `specification-foundation`, `actor-indexed-determination`,
+`decision-driven-design`, `canon-governance` and `product-cli` were found at
+`mindovermachine-dev`. `ai-development-foundations` was still at `Hafeok`. **The transfer date is
+not recorded**, and none is to be inferred from these records.
+
+The seed branch `claude/seed-specification-foundation-g6a2y0`, which records before that session
+name as the default branch, was found renamed `main`; the former name no longer resolves.
+
+What was repaired and what was left as provenance is recorded in
+`2026-10-06-post-move-repair/`.
